Title: AWAAZ
Episode: 1 - "Mummy, Bachao"
Credit: Written with the Monkey Magic method
Format: 9:16 vertical, 60 seconds, twelve 5-second beats
Language: Hindi (Hinglish). English action lines.
Draft date: 2026-10-04

====

[[ BEAT ENGINE: HOOK 0:00-0:05 | FRICTION 0:05-0:40 | SPIKE 0:40-0:50 | FRICTION 0:50-0:55 | BUTTON 0:55-1:00. Cut on the question, not the answer. ]]

.INT. RAO FLAT, PUNE - KITCHEN - NIGHT

[[ 0:00-0:05 HOOK. CU. Warm tungsten light. Steel utensils. Exhaust fan hum. ]]

SUSHMA RAO (58), hair in a loose bun, a small red bindi, hands white with flour, kneads dough on a steel plate. A phone buzzes on the counter. UNKNOWN NUMBER. She wipes her hands on her saree pallu, answers, presses it to her ear.

KABIR (PHONE)
(thin, tinny, crying; Kabir's voice)
मम्मी! मम्मी, मुझे बचा लो!

Her hands stop mid-motion. Her face drains.

SUSHMA
कबीर?

[[ 0:05-0:10 FRICTION. MCU. She leans on the counter. ]]

KABIR (PHONE)
(sobbing, rushed)
एक्सीडेंट हो गया। पुलिस ने पकड़ लिया।

Her floury fingers leave white prints on the steel counter as she grips it.

SUSHMA
हे भगवान! तू ठीक है?

.INT. SPARKMIND OFFICE, BENGALURU - NIGHT

[[ 0:10-0:15 FRICTION. MCU. Cool blue light, rain on the window. ]]

KABIR RAO (32), headphones around his neck, a yellow-and-black pencil in his right hand, types at a lit desk. His phone, face-up, lights up: MUMMY. He looks at it. His jaw tightens. He swipes it away with his thumb and flips it face-down.

KABIR
बाद में, मम्मी।

He goes back to typing. The pencil taps the desk.

.INT. RAO FLAT, PUNE - DINING TABLE - NIGHT

[[ 0:15-0:20 FRICTION. MS. Phone on the table on speaker. ]]

Sushma has sat down at the table. Her unfinished dinner is pushed aside. The phone lies on speaker in front of her.

KABIR (PHONE)
(tinny, panicking)
चालीस हज़ार यूपीआई करो। अभी। किसी को मत बताना।

She pulls her reading glasses down onto her nose, taps the screen with a shaking finger.

SUSHMA
भेज रही हूँ, बेटा।

[[ 0:20-0:25 FRICTION. CU face lit by the phone. ]]

She squints at the screen. Her lips move as she reads. She stops.

SUSHMA
ये नाम तो राहुल का है?

KABIR (PHONE)
(sharp, urgent)
जल्दी करो, मम्मी!

She flinches.

.INT. SPARKMIND OFFICE, BENGALURU - NIGHT

[[ 0:25-0:30 FRICTION. MCU two-shot. ]]

RIYA MENON (24), olive kurta, lanyard, carrying a mug, walks up. Kabir's phone, face-down on the desk, buzzes and creeps across the surface.

RIYA
कबीर, तुम्हारी मम्मी तीसरी बार कर रही हैं।

Kabir looks at the phone. The annoyance leaves his face.

KABIR
मम्मी कभी तीन बार नहीं करतीं।

He snatches the phone up.

.INT. RAO FLAT, PUNE - DINING TABLE - NIGHT

[[ 0:30-0:35 FRICTION. CU on the phone and her face. ]]

A call banner slides down over her screen: KABIR (a photo of a young man with round glasses). The scam call keeps talking on speaker. She looks from the banner to the speaker and back.

SUSHMA
तेरा फोन भी आ रहा है।

KABIR (PHONE)
(panicked, too fast)
पुलिस है! मत उठाओ, मम्मी!

Her thumb trembles above the banner.

.INT. SPARKMIND OFFICE, BENGALURU - NIGHT

[[ 0:35-0:40 FRICTION. Handheld two-shot. ]]

Kabir stands, the phone to his ear. A ring tone. It rings and rings. A busy beep.

KABIR
बिज़ी जा रहा है।

Riya, her laptop under her arm, frowns. She is thinking.

RIYA
तुमने क्लोनिंग का डेमो दिया था ना?

Kabir's eyes widen.

[[ 0:40-0:45 SPIKE. MCU. Mute test: a man looks at his own face on a screen and goes white. ]]

Riya opens her laptop and turns it to him. On the screen, a recorded stage talk: Kabir at a podium, mid-sentence, a headset microphone at his cheek. Kabir leans over it. The screen glows on his face.

RIYA
तीन सेकंड की आवाज़ काफ़ी होती है।

He covers his mouth with his hand.

KABIR
मेरी अपनी आवाज़।

[[ 0:45-0:50 SPIKE. Tracking shot, side-on. ]]

He bolts. The chair spins and bangs the desk. The pencil clatters to the floor. He sprints down the aisle between the desks, the phone at his ear, jacket flying.

KABIR
(shouting into the phone)
मम्मी, मत भेजना!

It rings. Nobody answers.

.INT. RAO FLAT, PUNE - DINING TABLE - NIGHT

[[ 0:50-0:55 FRICTION. ECU thumb and phone, then her face. ]]

The payment screen glows. A big green PAY button. Her thumb hovers over it. The call banner flashes at the top, KABIR CALLING, over and over.

KABIR (PHONE)
(sobbing, begging)
मम्मी, मुझसे प्यार है तो भेजो!

Tears run down Sushma's face. She whispers.

SUSHMA
कौन-सा कबीर?

[[ 0:55-1:00 BUTTON. ECU. Cut on the question. Freeze on the thumb at 0:57, hold, cut to black at 0:59.5. ]]

Her thumb trembles between the green ACCEPT on the banner above and the green PAY below. The ringtone and the muffled, begging voice overlap. The room sound drops away.

SMASH CUT TO BLACK.

SUPER: कौन-सा कबीर?

SUPER: EP 2 -->

====

[[ Notes for production: the cloned voice is always heard through a phone speaker, never from a mouth. Text on screens (UPI screen, call banners, laptop footage) is added in post. Pencil: Kabir's tell, three clicks before a risk. In this episode it taps the desk. In a later episode he sets it down. ]]
